Pure cultures of fungal isolates were obtained by monoconidial cultures. The list of isolates characterized in this study is reported in.  
Province of Reggio Calabria (RC), Calabria – Italy;  
Province of Messina (ME), Sicily–Italy;  
Province of Palermo (PA), Sicily – Italy;  
Province of Catania (CT), Sicily – Italy;  
Province of Syracuse (SR), Sicily – Italy;
